ets/steam/apps/2057620/extras/181d152a94e208b1fa681622b0c28c1c.avif?t=1678406545\" /></div><br><br>\u30fbSurvive and thrive by using multiple weapons. Pandemic 1993 features 6 weapons: 3 standard weapons, <br>\u30003 hidden weapons, and 3 weapons that you can't find in the game. <br><br>\u30fbTank Operation<br>\u3000Difficult maneuvering further exacerbates the fear<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">important point</h2><br>\u30fbThe game is fully compatible with the xbox controller, so even those who are not good at using a mouse or keyboard can play<br><br>\u30fbThe fastest play time is less than 1 hour, usually 2 hours",
